<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">DOCUMENT STUDIO</view><view class="title">每一份单据，<br/>从这里开始。</view><view class="subtitle">信用证信息与自定义要求，一处整理。</view><view class="notice">本地开发版 · 数据仅存于当前设备，暂未同步云端。清理小程序数据会删除本地资料。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view class="card row"><view><view class="muted">进行中业务</view><view class="count">{{count}}</view></view><view><view class="muted">已存模板</view><view class="count">{{templateCount}}</view></view><button class="primary" bindtap="create">新建业务</button></view><input placeholder="搜索业务、客户或信用证号" value="{{query}}" bindinput="search"/><view class="row" style="margin:28rpx 0"><view class="section" style="margin:0">{{archived ? '归档业务' : '我的业务'}}</view><button class="link" bindtap="toggleArchive">{{archived ? '查看进行中' : '查看归档'}}</button></view><view wx:if="{{!items.length}}" class="card empty">{{query ? '没有匹配的业务' : '还没有业务，点击“新建业务”开始'}}<view class="meta">可手动填写，也可导入信用证作为参考。</view></view><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="row"><view class="name grow">{{item.name}}</view><text class="tag {{item.issueCount ? 'warn' : ''}}">{{item.issueCount ? '待核对' : '可生成'}}</text></view><view class="meta">{{item.fields.lcNumber || '未填写信用证号'}} · {{item.updated}}</view><view class="meta">{{item.fields.buyer || '尚未填写买方'}}</view><view class="actions"><button class="primary" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open">继续制单</button><button data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="copy">复制业务</button><button class="link" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="archive">{{archived ? '恢复' : '归档'}}</button></view></view></view>
